=== plain-80: width 80, height 24, profile notty, dark, glyphs ascii, plain
  play logs/older ----------------------------------------------$
$
# Note$
# Play mode: hardn's Logs screen (pkg/screens/logs), inferred$
# from v0.3.2 and origin/main, read from a simulated host by the$
# real reader (pkg/engine/logview). It only reads: no plan, no$
# y/N, no journal. No pager runs: Open says what hardn would$
# run. Nothing on this machine changes: every command and file$
# is the fake's.$
$
# Info: logs/older$
# web-01.example.net runs Debian 13, less installed. hardn$
# renamed a log over 10 MiB to /var/log/hardn.log.1 and began$
# this one (docs/engine/design-log-rotation.md). The screen$
# reads the current file alone and names the older copy in a$
# row; hardn -p to a terminal does too.$
$
# Logs #########################################################$
$
  File ---------------------------------------------------------$
$
   -  Path                 /var/log/hardn.log$
   -  Size                 601 bytes$
   -  Older                /var/log/hardn.log.1$
$
  Last 3 of 10 lines -------------------------------------------$
$
      2026/10/20 12:00:05 ERROR: Failed to configure firewall:$
      | exit status 1$
      2026/10/20 12:05:11 INFO: Using configuration from:$
      | /etc/hardn/hardn.yml$
      2026/10/20 12:05:11 SUCCESS: debian trixie detected$
$
  Select an option$
$
   1) Open                 The whole log in less$
   2) Refresh              Read the log again$
$
   0) Return$
$
    > Option [0-2 or q]: 0$
$
  simulated system ---------------------------------------------$
$
# Note$
# Nothing was applied.$
$

